the delta code and replace the gpio_counter_update() call with something
like the following:

	switch (priv->function) {
	case COUNTER_FUNCTION_QUADRATURE_X4:
	case COUNTER_FUNCTION_QUADRATURE_X2_A:
	case COUNTER_FUNCTION_QUADRATURE_X1_A:
