+ * @MXL862XX_XPCS_LB_PMA_SERIAL: PMA TX-to-RX serial loopback
+ * @MXL862XX_XPCS_LB_PMA_PARALLEL: PMA RX-to-TX parallel loopback
+ */
+enum mxl862xx_xpcs_loopback_mode {
